            </note>
            <note corresp="#d906-f3" n="35" xml:id="d906-f3-content">
                <p>For further information regarding the organization, composition, and functioning
                    of the Sub-Commission, see <hi rendition="#italic">History of the United Nations
                        War Crimes Commission</hi>, pp. 129–131.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
